	# resolve without flagging the REAL normal generator as a false
	# failure. Kurtosis (the standardized 4th moment) is the shape
	# statistic that actually separates them: true normal has EXCESS
	# kurtosis 0, symmetric triangular has excess kurtosis exactly -3/5
